  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "eecdd72c-2ee9-4b61-b130-d658502260d9"],
 ", the default. Fewer than ",
 StyleBox["n", "TI"],
 " perpendiculars give ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "18eba6f2-6873-46bf-a73a-ce108bec8ec8"],
 ", and ",
 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "89efdb70-9992-4a83-8a0f-9d3957f5aad2"],
 " with a single perpendicular gives that graph rather than a list."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"2e09d90c-8f6a-4a8b-b04b-b59c22715b90"],

